            "description": {
              "value": "You know that for the best disguise to work, one requires not only the right skills but also the right look\u2014luckily you can copy both using special magical techniques. When you Impersonate, you don't need a disguise kit; instead, simple illusions or temporary transmutations ripple over your body like mirror shards, providing the supplies that the kit ordinarily would. When you Impersonate in this way, your Impersonate activity gains the occult trait."
